{
  "_readme": "DEVELOPMENT cases: used to build and fix the rule-based mock and the engine. Any case here has guided a fix and is a REGRESSION case, not unseen evidence. Fields: text (synthetic patient reply), expect.intent (closed vocabulary in ocp/models.py), expect.constraints (subset that must appear after validation), tags.",
